Looking at this problem, I need to find monic polynomials $p(x), q(x)$ with non-negative integer coefficients satisfying $\frac{1}{5x} \ge \frac{1}{q(x)} - \frac{1}{p(x)} \ge \frac{1}{3x^2}$ for all integers $x \ge 2$, minimizing $p(1)\cdot q(1)$.

